# Configuration Service (the Admin API replacement): read the claims behind the DMS walkthroughs.
#
# - Resource claims group API resources into domains (edFiTypes, systemDescriptors,
#   educationOrganizations, relationshipBasedData, ...). `?name=` matches a top-level domain.
# - Authorization metadata shows, per claim set, which actions each resource claim grants and with
#   which authorization strategy (NoFurtherAuthorizationRequired, RelationshipsWithEdOrgsAndPeople,
#   NamespaceBased, ...). Compare it with dms-sis-relationship.http and dms-assessment-namespace.http.
#
# Credentials: the bootstrap admin client (from .env). For the multi-tenant Configuration Service,
# use {{base}}/mt-config and add a `Tenant: tenant1` header to every /v3 request.

@base = https://your-label.eastus.cloudapp.azure.com
@cms = {{base}}/st-config
@adminKey = dms-bootstrap-admin
@adminSecret = REPLACE_WITH_BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_SECRET

### Get a Configuration Service token
# @name tokenRequest
# client_secret is sent form-urlencoded below: '+' decodes to a space and '%' starts an escape,
# so if the secret contains either, percent-encode those characters in this body.
POST {{cms}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{adminKey}}&client_secret={{adminSecret}}&grant_type=client_credentials&scope=edfi_admin_api/full_access

###
@token = {{tokenRequest.response.body.access_token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "edFiTypes"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=edFiTypes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "managedDescriptors"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=managedDescriptors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "systemDescriptors"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=systemDescriptors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "educationOrganizations"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=educationOrganizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "people"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=people
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "primaryRelationships"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=primaryRelationships
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "relationshipBasedData"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=relationshipBasedData
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the definition for which resources are in "assessmentMetadata"
GET {{cms}}/v3/resourceClaims?name=assessmentMetadata
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

#
# Claim sets used by the review-variant applications
#

### List claim sets
GET {{cms}}/v3/claimSets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actions and authorization strategies granted by SISVendor
GET {{cms}}/v3/authorizationMetadata?claimSetName=SISVendor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actions and authorization strategies granted by AssessmentVendor
GET {{cms}}/v3/authorizationMetadata?claimSetName=AssessmentVendor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actions and authorization strategies granted by EdFiSandbox
GET {{cms}}/v3/authorizationMetadata?claimSetName=EdFiSandbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Look up the SISVendor claim set by name
# @name sisVendorClaimSet
GET {{cms}}/v3/claimSets?name=SISVendor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export it: every resource claim with the actions it grants
GET {{cms}}/v3/claimSets/{{sisVendorClaimSet.response.body.$[0].id}}/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
